            "heading": "CUSTOM FABRICATION SERVICES",
            "enable_h1_tag": false,
            "heading_size": "h3",
            "description": "<p>We work with a wide range of materials, including carbon steel, aluminum, stainless steel, hastelloys, plastics, and other specialty metals, to cut, roll, form, and build the sheet metal configurations our customers need. From custom stainless steel fabrication to custom parts and full assemblies, our shop is built to handle it.Clients come to us for reliable results and fast delivery. We’ve built everything from mezzanines and catwalks to ladders, stairs, cabinets, and storage tanks, all made to meet project goals and timing.</p>",
